# covers: 0b 1.5, 1a 2.2
# 0b-move-rejected: a destination further than MAX_MOVE_DISTANCE_TILES (64) from the player is
# IntentRejected{TOO_FAR}; no Ack, the server position does not change.
#
# Timeouts (R1): the rejection is one round trip, 5 s. The 3 s pause is 30 server ticks, far more
# than the single tick a (wrongly accepted) move would need to show up.
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.EnterWorld
nf.WaitFor in_world 15
nf.ClickMove 100 100              # 141 tiles from the spawn at (0, 0)
nf.WaitFor rejected == TOO_FAR 5
nf.Sleep 3
nf.Expect acks == 0
nf.Expect own_at 0 0 1
nf.Within 45
